Inequality \eqref{eqn:ineqA} and \eqref{eqn:ineqB} are equivalent to
\begin{align}
    F(it) + \frac{18}{\pi^2} G(it) > 0 \label{eqn:ineqAnew} \\
    F(it) - \frac{18}{\pi^2} G(it) > 0 \label{eqn:ineqBnew}
\end{align}
respectively.
