\eqref{eqn:ddf} (resp. \eqref{eqn:ddg}) is positive (resp. negative) on the (positive) imaginary axis.
\end{corollary}

n45042.content:
\begin{proof}
From \eqref{eqn:E2} and Lemma \ref{cor:disc-pos},
\ifplastex
